message: "If you use this software, please cite it using these metadata."
title: mivia-small-json
type: software
authors:
  - name: MiviaLabs
    website: "https://mivia.app"
repository-code: "https://github.com/MiviaLabs/mivia-small-json"
abstract: >-
  Small CPU models that structure coding-workflow signals into strictly
  valid JSON: an 11-class schema router, a cross-encoder tool-match guard
  with honest abstention, learned field extractors, and zero-shot
  select/grade/verify primitives. CPU-only, under 2 GB RAM.
keywords:
  - json
  - onnx
  - text-classification
  - tool-calling
  - cpu-inference
  - structured-output
license: Apache-2.0
version: 1.0.0
date-released: "2026-10-11"
